Package: spectra
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.6), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.4), libssl3 (>= 3.0)
Maintainer: rakibulsagor <rakibulsagor@example.com>
Description: Native privacy-focused Linux Telegram client inspired by AyuGram
 Spectra is an independent Linux desktop Telegram client engineered in pure
 Rust, GTK4, and Libadwaita. It features Ghost Mode (read-receipt suppression,
 stealth typing, presence blocking), Anti-Recall local SQLite message preservation,
 Anti-Edit revision history tracking, and restricted channel media protection.
